OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start to Friday, but
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells for many. In the
OL,7,Fnorthwest, a cloudier picture. Feeling
OL,8,Fchilly with below average temperatures
OL,9,Fand light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOvernight it will be mostly
OL,12,Fcloudy with clear intervals but
OL,13,Ffeeling cold with widespread frost
OL,14,Faway from coasts. Winds will become
OL,15,Fbreezier towards Anglesey.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FSaturday will dry for most
OL,18,Fwith the odd shower in the northwest.
OL,19,FTemperatures recover slightly but stay
OL,20,Flargely below average. Later on, winds
OL,21,Fpick up along coasts and over hills.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
