OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,6,Fwill be wet, with a drier interlude on
OL,7,FMonday before more rain on Tuesday
OL,8,Fwhen winds pick up near coasts.
OL,9,FTemperatures initially average but
OL,10,Fdropping into Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
